chain: IS1001
language: en
note: REAL meetings: AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0) scenario series IS1001a-d, a role-played design team speaking spontaneously. Turns = AMI manual words merged per speaker (gap <= 2 s), turns under 2 words dropped. Gold = decisions listed in the human DECISIONS abstracts, evidence found through the human summary links; the slot list and allowed values were written by the AI assistant. Meeting dates are assigned (weekly) because AMI has none. Not the product's target domain (corporate board meetings).
now: 2026-03-02T00:00:00Z
people: id=Industrial Designer, me=Marketing Expert, pm=Project Manager, ui=User Interface Designer
object: channel_wheel | decision | Wheel for changing channels | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: lcd | decision | LCD screen | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: speech | decision | Speech recognition | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: shape | decision | Remote shape | outcome:enum[banana shape,standard shape]
object: colour | decision | Remote colour | outcome:enum[yellow,special colour]
object: case_material | decision | Case material | outcome:enum[spongy material,plastic,rubber,wood]
object: button_lights | decision | Lighted buttons | outcome:enum[included,excluded]!reverse
object: chip | decision | Chip | outcome:enum[standard chip,advanced chip]
object: battery | decision | Battery type | outcome:enum[standard batteries,rechargeable,kinetic]

